{
  "Description": [
    "ADNI no-MCI direct cocycle flow using optimized SIREN scan latents with real sequence rollout supervision, magnitude-aware progression supervision, and future-only latent OOD guards.",
    "Full 256D source latent, source normalized age, target normalized age, normalized age difference, and AD/CN label are fed to the velocity network.",
    "The time coordinate is the existing metadata continuous_age_norm = (continuous_age_years - 57.0) / 34.0. The flow multiplier is target_norm - source_norm.",
    "Keeps pair real target-SDF, observed cocycle, and virtual cocycle. Adds sequence rollout SDF, sequence direct-vs-rollout cocycle, pair and sequence displacement-magnitude supervision, latent displacement direction, and future latent cocycle.",
    "The latent manifold guard is applied only to future/OOD latents. Sequence weighting uses gap from the first scan so longer horizons matter more.",
    "No ODE solver, no volume loss, no disentanglement, no MCI, no raw-year delta."
